# __APP_NAME__

__PURPOSE__

This is the editable Unity empty template. It includes:

- a local web surface;
- an agent boundary with its prompt in `src/agent/prompts/system.md`;
- an AI Gateway configuration seam;
- exactly one intentionally empty Hosted Skill at `src/skills/__SKILL_NAME__/`;
- whole-app `dev-start` and `dev-stop` scripts.

The template does not invent domain tools. Implement the Hosted Skill directly in
source or open it in Intelligent Function App Studio.

## Run

```bash
./scripts/dev-start.sh
```

Open <http://localhost:3000>. Stop everything with:

```bash
./scripts/dev-stop.sh
```

The startup script uses the Microsoft Python package mirror and starts the local
mock agent and web surface. If Azure Functions Core Tools is installed, it also
starts the Hosted Skill.
